(1)       0 : =7                 DDRD:   equ     $07     ; Port D Data Direction Register
(1)       0 : =8                 MFTCSR: equ     $08     ; Multi-Function Timer Control/Status Register
(1)       0 : =9                 MFTCR:  equ     $09     ; Multi-Function Timer Counter Register
